msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫…………"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0daf6bc5177215e56ec7e47f11c193465b0122ac8d1ceb3944d875c482ba778
#. default-sha256: f979acf9ca0402c4bbf09324fb209b4d4243d3bc406978233227105bbac87f31
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a lot of pressure being under that much suspicion, huh. ⟪k:3⟫My heart was "
"pounding the whole time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫真是，⟪k:3⟫要犯心脏病了啊……⟪k:4⟫还以为被他怀疑了，好紧张呢。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2c507098ed9b13b431c4e805bf4eca10fc4ce16c6cf36c9484bf51b6b7f66b3
#. default-sha256: a0477d4f44f65731b4d498c26717f348cc7238d190c42d49b9fb2848273ada51
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why’d you tell him that, anyway?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫为什么要这么说？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5fbb1fd5656b328f718b1946853ce1210204db42f0617f21fe33447aec37cf1
#. default-sha256: 3d72727c598efcb3ff5b40122e08ea01810c97980a47376b3a4ae23463bbe125
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know, I know!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Besides, you have every intention of keeping your "
"promise, don’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我知道啦！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫而且，⟪k:5⟫你也不算在撒谎不是吗？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 679bbb2b01b3c06ef3637f12433944c5b208739a3b89d351cdb8a8ecc771cb30
#. default-sha256: 2c8b453570ae0c1d5fdad44f957690e9bbf4df5025e9f2217406d23259c00a82
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe, oh, you. You say it’s all on him,⟪k:3⟫but deep down, you know you’re on "
"his side."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫呵呵——⟪k:3⟫话是这么说，⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫但其实你是不想就这么放下他们不管吧？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fdb5671b705a5a54ef0197d18618b6fd35f83d91cc4f48c91d769638dabf959
#. default-sha256: a70d1f7a61bc658e8c2c3e84aece866a78c6662a0f3c05b9fb1665f08a57eaf6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re complete strangers to this Mell,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but I can’t bring myself to think "
"of him that way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我也一样，⟪k:3⟫没办法把他当做完全的陌生人来看待。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫这个时代的他，⟪k:6⟫虽然"
"是第一次和我们见面……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94740b6ba5b8486df462b373a51209a6fa4a13c60f6fe6e3a7fcc5121e11e784
#. default-sha256: 20f44e645f967e5a41474b79796e046a82217d33e4013eccfc4018997500207c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And you were actually there—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a part of his life—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫which I "
"imagine makes the sentiment all the stronger."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那是因为你和他的人生曾有过交集……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫才产生了这种感情吧？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6655de39dc18307425a642598f17e4d56a8f332abfbc2f64ab5ba621b4215a7f
#. default-sha256: 5c9a3847a187c0baf45acfc4c71410bcd6a1df226da7c6bdcbffe2b75cd7189f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫don’t think of him... ⟪k:3⟫as a total stranger, no.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫However..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫完全的陌生人吗……⟪k:3⟫我并不这么认为。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫不过……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc7e2fa40d7ac8bee1c585c224317c8f52a370f349f9a024e7aadd6ebcbda99b
#. default-sha256: 0f93c094bcfff92d156fe9517cb06521ac2fdd487cd83c55e0a4c9c5390db177
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s hard to say... ⟪k:3⟫but even if he doesn’t,⟪k:4⟫we still have the other two "
"men to worry about."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫怎么说呢……⟪k:3⟫就算他本人没有如此胆量，⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫也有那两个人在。⟪k:6⟫并不需要梅尔"
"亲自动手。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_39E3BBEC_9037_4D86_A16D_CD7BD0234D3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5ee574a6ee27e79413ce9b0ff2879279978594868490964b537579789b405d2
