msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wasn’t really... ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫there⟪k:5⟫ anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫就已经，⟪k:3⟫不太记得发生过什么了。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9A50CC6B_C148_442B_9AFD_882562B21A98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
