#: scenario8:scenario8_456D304C_18F8_49FE_B699_BB8FB0129127
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f51ac90eb09ce86ee93e70b68f1bd087599c65da7ae0d3e0daf92c9f65e658bc
#. default-sha256: 498147b7807f2a7429b6f81835863adb06dd8b253db54f36cc3acdc780cc3416
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_456D304C_18F8_49FE_B699_BB8FB0129127"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He bears a great deal of regret.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He yearns for someone to save him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫梅尔怀着后悔的心情。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……一直祈愿着，自己能被某人所救赎。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e49abdd599441d4f61eb54ad3924e18913c19fb4fda58bb2804241c4e94a7fe3
#. default-sha256: eb255780f968366452eb090ced42df893208e7ea404eb97f46454ea413baee52
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard him muttering, “This isn’t what I wanted.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He doesn’t want to be "
"involved in this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「明明不想这样的」——⟪k:2⟫那时，他的身影如此低喃着。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫发展成现在这样，⟪k:5⟫也一定"
"不是他的本心吧。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7dae2971883c12dae830bdac13367a7bdafa204397cd17687f46eafc79759bb
#. default-sha256: 24168ace2ef1dedaf59b0a3d6f9b1f5e9f7a204f173107f2038bf76627ba4f39
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But we have knowledge—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫quite a bit of it, in fact."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不过……我们至少，⟪k:3⟫知道很多事情。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d33d90ad0116dc475e5b37ec18725a75c4382e754125886e4187d14370089af5
#. default-sha256: 7921b7c4e84ea3c88532187652d03069433dadef45062bf9099e656def939cd5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I agree! If his darling sister tells him to stop,⟪k:3⟫he won’t have any reason to "
"continue his involvement!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫说得没错！⟪k:3⟫毕竟奈莉是他最珍视的妹妹，⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫如果奈莉对他说「不要这样！」，"
"⟪k:6⟫他就不会做这种事了！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c12c3f792ecf658fe187fec2aecf2442f53005d38faa7233f5605c9a03cc54da
#. default-sha256: 525dc84034100eaa42f0253899d30e29cb38db1f447e7874a70b0260b5cef5b0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫is that people tend to keep those they care most about close by."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫因为奈莉是梅尔重要的人，⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫所以一定会把她留在身边……吧。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C2FB13F6_DBC2_4FEE_8C81_AC7E38251B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e66c818ff9ea6790a3d954e170bc4727a3090c08ed6f7e9bd7ae1f3e543fb3c7
#. default-sha256: 2940e21fff9b2d5b7ad086ed737361b08a41a00a5aec7029a3846846b247d315
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C2FB13F6_DBC2_4FEE_8C81_AC7E38251B75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(It would appear I have a bad tendency to focus too much on the facts.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（我的思考方式，⟪k:2⟫只是一味循着事实）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_837E4EB5_6197_46D7_B145_2F8C50D9FDE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24304f0edeacef40249ed5a402337a2b44b1e9322cfe52fab3c77209d797aea0
